    "paragraph": "A Digital Twin–Based Simulation Framework for Safe Curve Speed Estimation Using Unity developed a physics-driven digital twin framework to calculate maximum safe driving speeds along horizontal road curves. Compound and cascading climate risks in urban infrastructure governance and resilience across North America introduced a comparative framework to analyze how compound climate hazards trigger domino effects across interconnected urban infrastructure systems. A new frontier of climate risk used a 25 km global gridded dataset from 1982 to 2023 to assess compound marine-terrestrial heatwaves across Small Island Developing States.",
